И CTPOKИ ПPИHAДЛEЖAЩИE MKП OБPAБATЫBAET, A BCE OCTAЛЬHЫE
B ЗABИCИMOCTИ OT '<IEQ' И '<IGE' ПEPEПИCЫBAET BO BPEMEHHYЮ
